WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.402
Ukrainian embassies and consulates around

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.770
Europe are on heightened alert

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.604
after being targeted

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:05.972
with suspicious packages

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.607
that include blood soaked

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.242
envelopes and animal parts.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.511
This comes just days after a letter bomb

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.879
sent to the Ukrainian embassy

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.581
in Madrid exploded,

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.082
injuring a Ukrainian employee.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:16.716
Ukraine's foreign

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:17.851
minister says he believes

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.319
this is a well-planned campaign

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.221
of terror and intimidation.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.758
And CNN's Matthew Chance spoke to him

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:27.560
Well, it started with an explosion

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.697
at the embassy of Ukraine in Spain.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.066
But what followed was

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.835
this explosion was more weird

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.171
and I would even say sick

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.174
because we started receiving letters

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:45.311
with eyes, animal eyes cut off animals.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.480
Animal rights, yes, in some cases.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.215
In one case, it's

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.351
most probably an eye of a cow

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:56.456
and an eye of a pig in another case.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.192
Let me ask you, who do you suspect?

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.994
Who does Ukraine suspect

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.329
of being behind this? Well,

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:05.565
of course, I feel

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.032
tempted to

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.568
say to name Russia straight away,

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.470
because,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.037
first of all,

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.105
you have to answer the question,

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:13.740
who benefits from that?

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:14.741
And

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.811
it's definitely this campaign is aimed

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:20.980
at sowing fear and terrorizing

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.182
Ukrainian diplomats.

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.850
Your infrastructure of the country

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.385
has been attacked repeatedly

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.587
by Russian missiles.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.322
You've got an anti-aircraft system

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.824
that is straining

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:34.227
to overcome those incoming attacks.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.830
How concerned are you

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.065
that this country will be unable

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:40.500
to survive the winter

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.336
unless Patriot missiles systems from

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.804
the United States

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.539
are deployed to this country?

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.907
I'm not concerned at all.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.275
We will survive.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.478
I do not have any single doubt

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:53.847
that we will get through this winter.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:54.747
The question is,

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.416
what will be the price

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.685
of getting through this winter, winter

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.420
and definitely having patriots,

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:01.921
having

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.023
other advanced air defense systems

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.127
delayed, being having them

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.462
delivered in Ukraine within weeks,

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.663
not months.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:11.698
Will dramatic

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:12.632
and lower the price

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:16.169
and will allow us to defend our cities

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.506
and our critical energy infrastructure?

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:23.743
Are you concerned that the approval

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:24.878
for those patriots

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:27.480
has not been given yet?

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:28.748
Well,

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.618
patriotism became a symbol

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.686
The you know, this is a US technology,

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:37.557
but now time has come to make decisions.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.425
So we are having this discussion.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:39.893
And yes,

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.860
I will not conceal

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.096
that it will be a huge help.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.464
It would really help us

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.932
to defend the country

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.501
and to minimize the price

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.472
we are paying for surviving

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:53.806
during the winter.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.875
You heard President Biden

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.978
yesterday in a press conference with

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:00.547
with the French leader

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.882
suggesting that he would be prepared

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:03.550
to sit down

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.083
and speak

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.218
with President

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.753
Putin of of Russia

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:09.122
to try and find a negotiated end

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.490
to this conflict.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.358
How did that make you feel

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.526
as a Ukrainian,

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.694
that the American president

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.496
was suggesting that he would be open

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:17.697
to that conversation?

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:18.932
Well, I think you missed one point

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.500
from President Biden's remark

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.368
because he said that this can only happen

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.104
if Putin

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.973
is ready to withdraw from Ukraine.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:29.042
And this is a very important detail

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.410
because if

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.312
any leader of the world is ready

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:34.581
just to sit down with Putin and talk

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:37.650
behind our back, that is a problem.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.885
But if the conditions

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:39.953
for the conversation

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:41.821
is the withdrawal of Russian army

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.390
from Ukraine and restoration

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.659
of our territorial territorial integrity,

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.428
we are fine with that.

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.296
Do you believe there is any possibility

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.232
Finally, the final question.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.733
Do you believe there is any possibility

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:54.467
at this stage,

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:55.902
any sign

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:59.138
of the green shoots of a peace process?

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:00.406
Is there anything that gives

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:02.642
you hope on that front?

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.843
No.

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:06.279
As we are anticipating another massive

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:09.449
missile attack by Russia

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:12.151
and the goal of this attack is to kind of

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.420
bring total destruction

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.189
to our energy system.

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:17.957
I don't think countries behave like this

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:20.760
if they want genuinely want peace.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:23.896
And as long as Putin prefers war,

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.499
we will prefer to fight and defeat him.

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:27.500
On the battleground

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:30.436
All right.

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.037
I want to bring in

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:33.106
former CIA chief of Russia operation,

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:33.940
Steve Hall.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:34.540
Steve,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.342
thanks as always for being with us.

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:36.876
I want to

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:39.579
begin by getting your reaction to the

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.713
this disturbing reporting

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:42.015
we just heard, blood-soaked

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:43.383
envelopes, animal parts

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.418
being mailed to Ukrainian embassies.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:46.919
What do you make of that?

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:49.489
I think I have to agree

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:50.757
with the Ukrainian foreign

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:51.491
minister there.

00:04:51.491 --> 00:04:51.991
I mean,

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:52.992
you know, there's

00:04:52.992 --> 00:04:53.559
I suppose

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:53.960
there are a lot

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.028
of different possibilities.

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:55.795
And of course,

00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:57.864
the investigations will continue

00:04:58.498 --> 00:05:00.033
But I think his question is right,

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.501
and that is who benefits from this?

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.735
And the answer is Russia.

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:03.436
So in addition

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:03.670
to that,

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:03.970
of course,

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:04.971
we know that the Russians

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:06.639
for the longest time

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.542
have done released strange and brutal

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:10.810
things outside of Russia

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.812
to include assassinating dissidents

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:13.212
and others

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:14.747
who are anti-Putin figures,

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:17.116
shooting them in parks, poisoning them.

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:17.884
So really,

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:19.352
when you look at it in that context

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:20.153
and also the Russians

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.721
talk a lot about hybrid warfare,

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:23.723
in other words, nontraditional means

00:05:23.723 --> 00:05:25.725
it doesn't it's not too much of a stretch

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:27.694
to think that this is probably

00:05:27.694 --> 00:05:29.262
most likely

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:31.331
some sort of Russian activity.

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:31.731
And Steve,

00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:32.298
we're also getting

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:33.333
some new reporting today

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:35.201
that Putin plans to visit the Russian

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:37.470
occupied area of the Donbas

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.505
region in eastern Ukraine.

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:40.440
Does that tell you

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.541
he feels secure

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.009
enough about that part of the country

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:44.310
right now? What does it say to you?

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:46.713
No, I don't think it's

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:47.980
an indication of his security.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.215
I think what it's an indication

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:51.417
is, is his really strong desire

00:05:51.417 --> 00:05:54.187
to show Russians that, yes, this remains

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:55.121
part of Russia.

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:57.123
Remember, he claims to annex

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:59.559
that part of Ukraine into Russia,

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:00.960
but he doesn't really control

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.861
all parts of it.

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:03.363
And many Russians know that

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.897
or have questions about that.

00:06:04.897 --> 00:06:07.066
And so he wants to go and show that, yes,

00:06:07.066 --> 00:06:08.234
this is indeed part of Russia.

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:10.069
Also, I wouldn't be walking around here.

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:12.038
I also think that it's probably

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:13.306
irritating to him to see sort

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:13.873
of a steady

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.575
flow of Western visitors

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:17.944
into Kiev and other parts of Ukraine

00:06:17.944 --> 00:06:19.912
when, you know, really his his

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:22.014
his military is not doing as well

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:24.417
in the areas that he claims to control.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.451
So I think this is almost more

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:27.253
for domestic consumption

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:29.055
than anything else, Jim.

00:06:29.088 --> 00:06:30.556
And he's been doing a lot of that lately.

00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:31.157
We saw him meeting

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:33.226
with those Russian mothers days ago

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:33.993
and so on.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.061
And Steve,

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:35.762
President Biden

00:06:35.762 --> 00:06:36.462
opened the door

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:37.597
to talking to Putin

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:39.098
if Putin is looking for a way

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:40.633
to end the war in Ukraine.

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:41.467
Biden added

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:42.902
he would also

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:44.971
do it in consultation with NATO's allies.

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:47.073
Moscow in Moscow,

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:48.441
the Kremlin says Putin is, quote,

00:06:48.441 --> 00:06:51.177
open to contacts and negotiations.

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:52.512
What do you make of all this?

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:55.948
Yeah, again, I think

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:56.682
the Ukrainian foreign

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:58.251
minister has got it right.

00:06:58.251 --> 00:06:58.584
You know,

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.119
Biden is not shutting down

00:07:00.119 --> 00:07:01.521
the idea of diplomacy,

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:02.221
but he is putting

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.556
a very important condition on it,

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:04.490
which is that

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.591
if Russia agrees

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:08.060
to withdraw entirely from Ukraine,

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.562
then discussions can begin.

00:07:09.562 --> 00:07:09.962
You know,

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.130
one of the things that you hear a lot

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.532
of, Jim, is you hear a lot of politicians

00:07:12.532 --> 00:07:12.932
saying, well,

00:07:12.932 --> 00:07:14.400
this is Ukraine's decision

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.401
And on one level, that's

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:16.669
absolutely right.

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:16.969
And I

00:07:16.969 --> 00:07:18.171
it is my great hope

00:07:18.171 --> 00:07:19.372
that we continue to provide

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:20.173
as we meaning

00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:21.240
the Western United States,

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.342
as many weapons and other assistance

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:24.844
we can to the Ukrainians.

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:25.778
That said,

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:27.947
if the West either tires of this or loses

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:28.881
focus on this,

00:07:28.881 --> 00:07:30.550
which is what Russia is counting on,

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.684
then it's going to be much harder

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:33.252
for the Ukrainians, you know,

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.854
to really decide their own fate.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:35.588
They can really only

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:36.656
decide their own fate

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:38.491
if we give them the tools

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:39.425
with which to do it.

00:07:39.425 --> 00:07:40.893
So let's let's hope that that continues.

00:07:42.195 --> 00:07:42.595
All right.

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:43.162
Steve Hall,

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:44.831
thank you very much for that time.

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:45.498
We appreciate it.

